# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# ReplyAI — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.development.local for local dev.
# Never commit .env.development.local to git.

# Required: your Convex deployment URL
# Get it from: npx convex dev (printed on first run)
VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://your-deployment.convex.cloud

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI Provider API Keys (set via Convex, not .env)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are set as Convex environment variables, NOT in this file.
# Run one of the following (you only need the provider you want to use):
#
#   npx convex env set GROQ_API_KEY       your_groq_key_here
#   npx convex env set GEMINI_API_KEY     your_gemini_key_here
#   npx convex env set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY  your_anthropic_key_here
#   npx convex env set OPENAI_API_KEY     your_openai_key_here
#
# Then go to /admin to select the active provider.
#
# Free options:
#   Groq   — 14,400 req/day free → https://console.groq.com
#   Gemini — 1,500 req/day free  → https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# Paid options:
#   Anthropic → https://console.anthropic.com
#   OpenAI    → https://platform.openai.com/api-keys

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Admin Panel Password (set via Convex)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set this as a Convex environment variable (not here):
#
#   npx convex env set ADMIN_PASSWORD your_secure_password_here
#
# This protects the /admin route.
